=== file: README.md ===
# Article bullet summary and support check

This workflow summarizes a supplied article as exactly five bullets, checks each bullet against the article with a separate verifier, and permits one revision followed by one recheck. If any bullet remains unsupported, it asks a human reviewer for an assessment and returns the result marked `human_review_required`. It never presents that result as verified.

All three agents mask personal information before processing article content. They have no tools and cannot send or publish anything.

## Run and test

Run the workflow with the `Main` workflow and provide the article as `supplied_article`. For example:

```text
weave run main.loom -w Main -i supplied_article="The article text"
weave test main.loom
```

The model name is declared in `main.loom`; configure the corresponding provider credentials in the runtime environment. Human review is requested only when support remains unresolved after the single recheck.
=== end ===
